{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cghw5YPmbMKKWoNgASJdG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VUwj3hnRf4oaDR2oedWxKv","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261104-050232__xd92716/work/DenshaDeHalo-DenshaDeGo-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-050232; python3 - <<'EOF'\np='engine/my-3d2dge.js'; s=open(p).read()\ndef rep(a, b):\n    global s\n    assert a in s, a[:80]; s = s.replace(a, b, 1)\nrep(\"const pk = this.poseW || (this.poseW = { cheer: 0, cast: 0, guard: 0, kneel: 0, crouch: 0, wave: 0, hips: 0, block: 0 });\",\n    \"const pk = this.poseW || (this.poseW = { cheer: 0, cast: 0, guard: 0, kneel: 0, crouch: 0, wave: 0, hips: 0, block: 0, bow: 0, point: 0, flag: 0 });   // (DENSHA: bow, point, flag)\")\nrep(\"    const leanF = (o.lean + .16 * sp * mf + .45 * dash + this._atkLean - .35 * hurt + cr * .22 + snk * .34 + spr * .3 + ld * .42) * (1 - hw) + hw * .06, leanR = .1 * sp * mr;\",\n    \"    const leanF = (o.lean + .16 * sp * mf + .45 * dash + this._atkLean - .35 * hurt + cr * .22 + snk * .34 + spr * .3 + ld * .42 + (PW.bow || 0) * .7) * (1 - hw) + hw * .06, leanR = .1 * sp * mr;   // (DENSHA: a bow leans about 40 degrees)\")\nrep(\"    J.head = add(shC, V3.mul(V3.norm([dir[0] + o.hunch * .9, dir[1], dir[2]]), o.neck + o.headR));\",\n    \"    J.head = add(shC, V3.mul(V3.norm([dir[0] + o.hunch * .9 + (PW.bow || 0) * .5, dir[1], dir[2]]), o.neck + o.headR));\")\nrep(\"      if (PW.hips > 0) hand = V3.lerp(hand, add(s > 0 ? J.hipR : J.hipL, [-.2, s * 1.5, 1.5]), PW.hips);\",\n    \"\"\"      if (PW.hips > 0) hand = V3.lerp(hand, add(s > 0 ? J.hipR : J.hipL, [-.2, s * 1.5, 1.5]), PW.hips);\n      if (PW.bow > 0) hand = V3.lerp(hand, add(s > 0 ? J.hipR : J.hipL, [1.2, s * .6, -1.6]), PW.bow);   // (DENSHA) a bow: hands at the thighs\n      if (PW.point > 0 && s > 0) hand = V3.lerp(hand, add(sh, [armLen * .95, -.4, 0]), PW.point);         // (DENSHA) point: the right arm straight out\n      if (PW.flag > 0 && s > 0) hand = V3.lerp(hand, add(sh, [.8, .6, armLen * .9]), PW.flag);            // (DENSHA) flag: the right arm raised\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\nnode --check engine/my-3d2dge.js && echo syntax-ok; cat >> ENGINE-CHANGES.md <<'EOF'\n2. **Dialog voice hook** (`Dialog.update`): `talk.voice` may be a function `(ch, index, text, talk)`, called for each revealed character, so\n   gibberish voices (Babble) speak syllables as the text types. Before, `voice` was only an sfx name blipped every second letter.\n3. **Settings screen filter** (`Shell._settingsRows`, `_render`): `ui.show('settings', { groups: ['Dev'], title })` shows only those groups,\n   with a \"Reset to defaults\" button; the standard Settings screen hides the `Dev` group. Dev Mode's live balance sliders come free this way,\n   navigable by controller, keyboard and mouse.\n4. **Glyphs**: the standard `glyphs` setting defaults to `'playstation'` (TASK.md: PlayStation glyphs unless the player picks Xbox), and the\n   5x7 font gains `✕ ○ □ △`, so any `input.label()` text renders on canvas.\n5. **ChipAudio accessors**: `audio.bus('sfx' | 'music' | 'master')` and `audio.noiseBuffer()`, so the game's continuous train synth and the\n   Babble voices route through the player's volume, mute and ducking.\n6. **Humanoid poses** `'bow'` (about 40 degrees, hands at the thighs, head down), `'point'` (right arm straight out) and `'flag'` (right arm\n   raised), blended like the others in `poseW` and the solver: platform staff, track workers and the finale need them.\n7. **Hub button rule** (`Input.tick`): while `AIHub.active` and Create (Pad8) is held, Options (Pad9) is not pressed, so the hub's corner bar\n   (Create + Options) never pauses the game (hub README, Rules).\nEOF\necho logged","description":"Add bow/point/flag poses; log engine changes"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":744,"cache_read_input_tokens":582200,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":744},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7b1bf799-1946-4a15-a1b7-75e4a7d99d2e","uuid":"29aa25c9-76dc-4dc7-9966-a003e338836e","timestamp":"2026-11-04T13:03:07.195Z","request_id":"req_011Cghw5Y7QtwjHtvdULBmfq","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01VUwj3hnRf4oaDR2oedWxKv":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261104-050232__xd92716/work/DenshaDeHalo-DenshaDeGo-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-050232; python3 - <<'EOF'\np='engine/my-3d2dge.js'; s=open(p).read()\ndef rep(a, b):\n    global s\n    assert a in s, a[:80]; s = s.replace(a, b, 1)\nrep(\"const pk = this.poseW || (this.poseW = { cheer: 0, cast: 0, guard: 0, kneel: 0, crouch: 0, wave: 0, hips: 0, block: 0 });\",\n    \"const pk = this.poseW || (this.poseW = { cheer: 0, cast: 0, guard: 0, kneel: 0, crouch: 0, wave: 0, hips: 0, block: 0, bow: 0, point: 0, flag: 0 });   // (DENSHA: bow, point, flag)\")\nrep(\"    const leanF = (o.lean + .16 * sp * mf + .45 * dash + this._atkLean - .35 * hurt + cr * .22 + snk * .34 + spr * .3 + ld * .42) * (1 - hw) + hw * .06, leanR = .1 * sp * mr;\",\n    \"    const leanF = (o.lean + .16 * sp * mf + .45 * dash + this._atkLean - .35 * hurt + cr * .22 + snk * .34 + spr * .3 + ld * .42 + (PW.bow || 0) * .7) * (1 - hw) + hw * .06, leanR = .1 * sp * mr;   // (DENSHA: a bow leans about 40 degrees)\")\nrep(\"    J.head = add(shC, V3.mul(V3.norm([dir[0] + o.hunch * .9, dir[1], dir[2]]), o.neck + o.headR));\",\n    \"    J.head = add(shC, V3.mul(V3.norm([dir[0] + o.hunch * .9 + (PW.bow || 0) * .5, dir[1], dir[2]]), o.neck + o.headR));\")\nrep(\"      if (PW.hips > 0) hand = V3.lerp(hand, add(s > 0 ? J.hipR : J.hipL, [-.2, s * 1.5, 1.5]), PW.hips);\",\n    \"\"\"      if (PW.hips > 0) hand = V3.lerp(hand, add(s > 0 ? J.hipR : J.hipL, [-.2, s * 1.5, 1.5]), PW.hips);\n      if (PW.bow > 0) hand = V3.lerp(hand, add(s > 0 ? J.hipR : J.hipL, [1.2, s * .6, -1.6]), PW.bow);   // (DENSHA) a bow: hands at the thighs\n      if (PW.point > 0 && s > 0) hand = V3.lerp(hand, add(sh, [armLen * .95, -.4, 0]), PW.point);         // (DENSHA) point: the right arm straight out\n      if (PW.flag > 0 && s > 0) hand = V3.lerp(hand, add(sh, [.8, .6, armLen * .9]), PW.flag);            // (DENSHA) flag: the right arm raised\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\nnode --check engine/my-3d2dge.js && echo syntax-ok; cat >> ENGINE-CHANGES.md <<'EOF'\n2. **Dialog voice hook** (`Dialog.update`): `talk.voice` may be a function `(ch, index, text, talk)`, called for each revealed character, so\n   gibberish voices (Babble) speak syllables as the text types. Before, `voice` was only an sfx name blipped every second letter.\n3. **Settings screen filter** (`Shell._settingsRows`, `_render`): `ui.show('settings', { groups: ['Dev'], title })` shows only those groups,\n   with a \"Reset to defaults\" button; the standard Settings screen hides the `Dev` group. Dev Mode's live balance sliders come free this way,\n   navigable by controller, keyboard and mouse.\n4. **Glyphs**: the standard `glyphs` setting defaults to `'playstation'` (TASK.md: PlayStation glyphs unless the player picks Xbox), and the\n   5x7 font gains `✕ ○ □ △`, so any `input.label()` text renders on canvas.\n5. **ChipAudio accessors**: `audio.bus('sfx' | 'music' | 'master')` and `audio.noiseBuffer()`, so the game's continuous train synth and the\n   Babble voices route through the player's volume, mute and ducking.\n6. **Humanoid poses** `'bow'` (about 40 degrees, hands at the thighs, head down), `'point'` (right arm straight out) and `'flag'` (right arm\n   raised), blended like the others in `poseW` and the solver: platform staff, track workers and the finale need them.\n7. **Hub button rule** (`Input.tick`): while `AIHub.active` and Create (Pad8) is held, Options (Pad9) is not pressed, so the hub's corner bar\n   (Create + Options) never pauses the game (hub README, Rules).\nEOF\necho logged","description":"Add bow/point/flag poses; log engine changes"}}}
