o end, and the transcript does not show a full check of every TASK.md item against the bundle. Therefore the condition is not clearly satisfied.\"\n   - (Several system \"say what you're doing\" nudges, not user requests.)\n\n7. Pending Tasks:\n   - Add a browser check pass (in test/browser.mjs) exercising EVERY Dev Mode tool through its real Shell buttons on the bundle, verifying effects: Auto-drive (train moves alone after resume), skill toggle, God mode (no grace loss), Freeze Halo Time (run.frozen), Time scale (game.timeScale/DH.devTimeScale), Jump next station approach (s ≈ target−600), Jump to km change + Go to km, Skip to next stop (lastJudgment PERFECT), Finish (results scene), Fail (gameOver), Time of day (DH.devTod), Weather (run.weather), Force next signal (run.forced), all six Trigger events — including DOOR RUSH fired during the S1 start dwell at Akari Central (station) while paused, then resume and verify doors reopen (dwell.rush opened / 'doorRush'), plus OBSTRUCTION (events.obst active, emitter on), ONCOMING, TRACK WORKERS (events.workers), HEADLIGHT FLASH (events.flash), ATS TEST — Camera cycle (DH.drive.cam), Debug overlay (DH.debugOn), Braking guide (settings.guide), Unlock all (progress unlocked all), Reset save data (Keep/Erase), Balance sliders, Sound board.\n   - Add static bundle checks vs TASK.md (file name exists, `<meta charset>` then unmodified session.js first, hub tags, title, no external `src=`, no audio files/`new Audio(`, About contains all Source Information labels and feedback, no TODO/FIXME/placeholder in non-engine scripts), runnable under `--bundle`.\n   - Rebuild bundle if source changes (`node tools/gen-index.mjs && node tools/bundle.mjs`), update 58-about-text.js browser-check count if changed (escape apostrophes!), regenerate `node tools/exit-interview.mjs`, `mkdir -p .tmp` then run `TMPDIR=$PWD/.tmp node test/run.mjs --browser --hub --bundle` as the very last code step; clean `.tmp` and `test/.serve`; only stop own processe