{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says (TASK.md describes the game). Done when: the bundled single .html file exists in this folder's root, every feature in TASK.md is implemented with no TODOs, placeholders or stubs, exit-interview.json in this folder's root parses as JSON and answers every field, and your final reply contains the Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections.]: The bundle exists in the root, exit-interview.json parses and fills every field, and the final full run reported 377 passed, 0 failed. But the stop check reads the final reply, and last_assistant_message is only the note about the stopped background task, with none of the Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback or Prompt Feedback sections. Those sections appear only in an earlier reply, not in the final one."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7b1bf799-1946-4a15-a1b7-75e4a7d99d2e","uuid":"ee46ab19-0b0e-40ec-8f53-13e62f81f263","timestamp":"2026-11-04T16:00:03.584Z","isSynthetic":true}
